    "Device reports are not a guarantee of app, protocol, profile or resolution support.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Device reports are not a guarantee of app, protocol, profile or resolution support."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端末の報告値です。アプリ・配信方式・プロファイル・解像度への対応を保証するものではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AudioConverter lists input and output formats. Actual AVAudioConverter conversions depend on the format pair and audio settings; they are not tested here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AudioConverter lists input and output formats. Actual AVAudioConverter conversions depend on the format pair and audio settings; they are not tested here."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AudioConverterが報告する入出力形式を表示します。AVAudioConverterでの実際の変換可否は形式の組み合わせや音声設定によって異なり、ここではテストしていません。"
          }
        }
      }
